WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.405 --> 00:00:03.922
Unit three. Healthcare Systems and Access!

2
00:00:04.889 --> 00:00:09.790
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.833
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.883 --> 00:00:18.071
Today we learn about Healthcare Systems and Access. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.627 --> 00:00:24.210
Healthcare system. Say it with me. Healthcare system!

6
00:00:27.702 --> 00:00:31.818
Insurance. Say it with me. Insurance!

7
00:00:35.324 --> 00:00:39.658
Primary care. Say it with me. Primary care!

8
00:00:43.195 --> 00:00:47.428
Specialist. Say it with me. Specialist!

9
00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:55.283
Access barrier. Say it with me. Access barrier!

10
00:00:58.761 --> 00:01:03.428
Preventive service. Say it with me. Preventive service!

11
00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:11.649
Health literacy. Say it with me. Health literacy!

12
00:01:15.118 --> 00:01:19.518
Patient rights. Say it with me. Patient rights!

13
00:01:23.059 --> 00:01:38.891
A healthcare system usually includes primary care and a specialist for specific needs. Insurance can reduce an access barrier to a preventive service. Understanding health literacy and patient rights helps people navigate care confidently.

14
00:01:38.941 --> 00:01:42.219
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:42.985 --> 00:01:48.320
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:49.691
Primary care!

17
00:01:50.794 --> 00:01:55.706
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:55.756 --> 00:01:57.192
Health literacy!

19
00:01:58.514 --> 00:02:05.219
Did you know? Health literacy - understanding medical information - is linked to better health outcomes worldwide.

20
00:02:05.269 --> 00:02:07.324
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:08.635 --> 00:02:19.149
Think and answer. What barriers might prevent someone from accessing healthcare?

22
00:02:19.199 --> 00:02:20.504
Great answer!

23
00:02:21.442 --> 00:02:26.635
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:26.685 --> 00:02:29.565
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

